libkws_feature — KWS Mel-Spectrogram Feature Frontend Library
=============================================================

Copyright (c) 2026, Realtek Semiconductor Corporation. All rights reserved.

SPDX-License-Identifier: LicenseRef-Realtek-5-Clause

This library is proprietary software owned by Realtek Semiconductor Corporation.
It is provided as part of the Realtek RTL87x2G TinyML SDK and is subject to
the terms of the separate agreement or license under which it was provided.

It extracts log-Mel spectrogram features (16 kHz, 30 ms window, 10 ms step,
40 Mel channels, PCAN noise suppression) matching the wake-word model's
training configuration. Public API: kws_frontend.h.

This library incorporates the following third-party components:

